---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 历史归档
permalink: archive/index.html
---
<section class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE</p>
  <h1>历史归档</h1>
  <p>按时间浏览所有已发布的情报报告。</p>
</section>
{% if collections.digests.length %}
  <ol class="archive-list">
    {% for post in collections.digests %}
      <li>
        <time>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <span class="pill">{{ post.data.type | typeLabel }}</span>
        <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
{% else %}
  <div class="empty-state"><p>尚无报告。PoC 写入第一篇 Markdown 后，这里会自动更新。</p></div>
{% endif %}

